sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host MCP client
    participant RS as MCP Resource Server
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    Note over H: proactive path, up to 5 min before expiry
    H->>AS: POST /token refresh_token R1, client_id, DPoP proof if bound
    AS->>AS: lock R1, rotate atomically, seal response for 30 s
    AS-->>H: token A2, refresh token R2
    Note over H: reactive path, on 401
    H->>RS: tools/call with expired token A1
    RS-->>H: 401 invalid_token
    H->>AS: POST /token refresh_token R2
    AS-->>H: token A3, refresh token R3
    H->>RS: retry tools/call with A3
    RS-->>H: 200
    Note over H,AS: race: two workers both send R3
    par worker 1
        H->>AS: refresh with R3
        AS-->>H: A4, R4
    and worker 2
        H->>AS: refresh with R3, waits on the row lock
        AS-->>H: inside grace, the identical A4 and R4
    end
    Note over H: both workers hold the same pair. The family stays linear.
    H->>AS: refresh with R3 again after 30 s
    AS-->>H: invalid_grant, grant revoked, alert raised
